[TITLE]
Low-flow Darcy-Weisbach network (hand-made noodl test fixture)
Pipe flows span Re < 2000, 2000..4000 and > 4000, so EPANET's Hagen-Poiseuille,
Dunlop and Swamee-Jain branches are all exercised; roughness in mm (SI).
Accuracy 1e-8 so that the EPANET reference is converged to its float32 output.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID              	Elev        	Demand      	Pattern
 J1              	0           	0           	                	;
 J2              	0           	0.06        	                	;
 J3              	0           	0.05        	                	;
 J4              	0           	0.10        	                	;
 J5              	0           	0.02        	                	;

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID              	Head        	Pattern
 R1              	2           	                	;

